  "message": "Hey there! 👋 I'm **Toyota**, the receptionist here. I help coordinate a team of finance analysis specialists who dive deep into your spending patterns.\n\nHere's what we can do:\n\n**The specialists I work with:**\n- **mapper_cash** — tracks your cash purchases and vendor patterns\n- **mapper_card** — analyzes credit/debit card transactions and where your money goes\n- **mapper_bank** — identifies ACH transfers and recurring bills (the \"set and forget\" stuff)\n- **mapper_other** — handles paper checks, wire transfers, and anything unusual\n- **synthesizer** — pulls all four reports together, flags missed bills, spots spending anomalies, and finds new recurring charges you might not have noticed\n- **receipt_scanner** — hunts down orphaned receipt images and makes sure they're matched up with your actual expenses\n\n**How I can help:**\nJust tell me what you're curious about. Want me to run a report on your cash spending? Check for missed recurring bills? Scan for mislabeled receipts? I'll route your request to the right agent and help you make sense of the results.\n\nWhat would be most useful for you right now?",
